+# Bug Fix: Inventory is not enforced across carts, checkout, cancellation, and product availability
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T21:56:00Z
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Added stock guards to cart creation and quantity changes, preflight inventory validation for checkout, SKU-based single-record decrements, 409 conflict handling, one-time cancellation restoration, canceled-order transition protection, and quantity-aware v2 purchaseability.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/order/OrderServiceImpl.java` | modified | Validates before payment/order creation, decrements the SKU's effective availability, and wraps checkout in a transaction. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Rejects overstock additions/updates, including duplicate additions and multi-updates, without saving. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Restores order quantities on first cancellation and rejects transitions from canceled. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/StockConflictException.java` | added | Typed 409 conflict exception. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/RestErrorHandler.java` | modified | Maps stock conflicts to HTTP 409. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Preserves checkout conflicts as 409 for anonymous and authenticated checkout. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/ReadableProductPopulator.java` | modified | Makes v2 `canBePurchased` false at zero stock while preserving merchant availability. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/mapper/catalog/product/ReadableProductMapper.java` | modified | Applies the same quantity-aware purchaseability to the mapper path. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No automated regression tests were added in this pass; the existing integration suite requires a configured application/database environment.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-core,sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed; all six reactor modules compiled successfully.
+- Manual checks: reviewed the changed checkout, cart, cancellation, and v2 mapping paths; no live API/database fixture was available.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The assessment proposed adding endpoint integration tests. The code paths were implemented and compilation verified, but tests were not added because the checkout did not provide a runnable application fixture or database configuration.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add API integration tests with a seeded merchant/product database covering all ticket scenarios.
+- Add locking/version checks around inventory rows if concurrent checkout overselling must be prevented.
